{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes.     If object seen, approach it. If close, grab it. Then process object and move to destination.     list of available nodes: <Action ID = GrabObject    /> <Action ID = MoveToDestination    /> <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    /> <SubTree ID = ProcessObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Action ID = TakeObject    />  <Condition ID = IsObjectApproached    />\"",
